  "solution": {
    "text": "Displacement $y(t)=A \\sin (\\mathrm{w} t+\\phi)$ [Given]\nFor $\\phi=\\frac{2 \\pi}{3}$\nat $t=0 ; y=A \\sin \\phi=A \\sin \\frac{2 \\pi}{3}$\n$$\n=A \\sin 120^{\\circ}=0.87 \\mathrm{~A}\\left[\\because \\sin 120^{\\circ} \\simeq 0.866\\right]\n$$\nGraph (a) depicts $y=0.87 A$ at $t=0$",
